  "notes": "{勧|すす}める means to recommend or advise someone to do something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{勧|すす}める (to recommend X to someone)\n\nKANJI VARIANTS (same reading, different nuances):\n- {勧|すす}める: to recommend, advise (general)\n- ⟦{薦|すす}める→薦める：27814_susumeru⟧: to recommend (more formal)\n- ⟦{進|すす}める→進める：01949_susumeru⟧: to advance, proceed (different meaning!)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{本|ほん}→本：00111_hon⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{勧|すす}める: to recommend a book\n- ⟦{医者|いしゃ}→医者：02847_isha⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勧|すす}められた: was recommended by a doctor\n- お{勧|すす}め: recommendation (noun form)\n\nUSEFUL EXPRESSION:\nお{勧|すす}め⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{何|なん}→何：00498_nani⟧です⟦か→か：09473_ka⟧? (What do you recommend?) - common at restaurants.",
